2. Selection Sort

Algorithm:

SelectionSort(arr, n)
Step 1: Start
Step 2: Repeat for i = 0 to n - 2:
2.1: min_index = i
2.2: Repeat for j = i + 1 to n - 1:
2.2.1: If arr[j] < arr[min_index], then min_index = j
2.3: If min_index != i, swap arr[i] and arr[min_index]
Step 3: Exit / Stop


Time Complexities:
Best Case: O(n^2)
Average Case: O(n^2)
Worst Case: O(n^2)
